## Messages reported to the Web Console by DOM code.

dom-get-element-by-id-empty-param = Kowöl rupam ri cholajil xq'asäx pa getElementById().
dom-document-write-ignored = Jun oyonïk chi re ri dokument.write() pa jun rij rucholajem tz'ib'anïk, ri samajib'en pa meximojri'ïl xrepüx ruwa.
# Variables:
#   $tagName (String) - Tag name of the element that starts the loop.
#   $id (String) - ID of the element.
dom-svg-reference-loop = Ri SVG <{ $tagName }> rik'in ID “{ $id }” k'o jun rutzolinel retal.
# Variables:
#   $tagName (String) - Tag name of the element where the chain was broken.
#   $id (String) - ID of the element.
dom-svg-reference-chain-length-exceeded = Jun SVG <{ $tagName }> ri rucholajem retal, ri yalan yuquyïk xtanab'äx kan pa ri ch'akulal rik'in ri ID “{ $id }”.
